ARDY Mini
Copyright 2026 intsuc

This repository is an unofficial derivative of ARDY:
https://github.com/nv-tlabs/ardy

The upstream ARDY source at commit
693f74d13b3d04a0a22ce127ee79c929dd89756b is preserved under Apache-2.0.
Files changed from that source carry a prominent modification notice.

The derivative adds a distilled MiniLM text-encoder runtime, training and
evaluation tools, interactive-demo integration, a local-only browser export
and WebGPU-only demo, tests, and aggregate benchmark documentation. It
is not affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA.

No pretrained or fine-tuned model weights, ARDY checkpoints, external
datasets, teacher caches, prompt manifests, prompt-level evaluation reports,
or generated motions are distributed in this repository. See
THIRD_PARTY_MODELS_AND_DATA.md for the separate terms that govern resources
used by the training, evaluation, and kinematic-constraint demo workflows.
